('居住与城市',['What do you like about the area where you live?','Is it a convenient place for students?','Has the area changed recently?'],'Describe a public place you enjoy spending time in.',['where it is','what it is like','what you do there','and explain why you enjoy it'],['What makes a public space accessible?','Should cities prioritise cars or pedestrians?','How can residents influence changes in their neighbourhood?'],['描述一处可具体回忆的空间，用一次经历支撑感受。','P3 从个人偏好转向不同群体的需要。'],['within walking distance','a sense of community']),
('技术与沟通',['Which device do you use most often?','Do you like learning to use new technology?','When do you prefer talking in person?'],'Describe a time technology helped you solve a problem.',['what the problem was','which technology you used','how you used it','and explain how helpful it was'],['Does technology always save time?','How can people judge information online?','Should schools restrict students’ use of devices?'],['不只列功能，讲问题与具体步骤。','讨论收益时补上使用条件。'],['figure out how it works','check the source']),
