('文化与阅读',['What do you like reading?','Did you visit museums as a child?','Do you prefer reading on paper or on a screen?'],'Describe a book or article that made you think.',['what it was about','how you found it','which idea interested you','and explain why it made you think'],['What is the role of libraries today?','Should museums be free to visit?','How do people decide which information to trust?'],['可以选短文章，准确讲一个观点。','P3 比较知识获取与公共服务。'],['see something from a different angle','follow up on an idea']),
('交通与旅行',['How do you usually get around?','What do you do during a journey?','Do you like planning trips in detail?'],'Describe a journey that did not go as planned.',['where you were going','what happened','how you responded','and explain what you learned'],['Why do people continue to use private cars?','What makes public transport reliable?','How can tourism affect residents?'],['事件链清楚：计划→变化→应对→感想。','无需虚构危险事件。'],['change plans at short notice','allow extra time']),
